{"login": "yyny", "location": "Netherlands \ud83c\uddf3\ud83c\uddf1\ud83c\uddea\ud83c\uddfa", "commits": [{"sha": "dd1c73bcd23bd43a136717a165e0b7ae3392e1cf", "message": "Add examples\n\nAdd some more advanced examples, that use nestled loops.", "created_at": "2016-11-01T19:39:01Z", "repo": "Brainfuck-In-Batch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "d112e220efe4d491a082895d9cc9de312ccd75a7", "message": "Fix stack\n\nFixes the stack implementation, as it popped too early, a problem only\nnoticable with a loop depth greater than one (as `%TOP%` is preserved if\nthe stack is empty).\nIt also used to skip the first instruction after a loop (the character\nafter the `]`) if the loop (from the `[` character, skipping a loop\nat `]` works fine) was skipped.", "created_at": "2016-11-01T19:33:13Z", "repo": "Brainfuck-In-Batch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "46c298a9f2324eb8127926830284b54483f7d02e", "message": "Fix SETLOCAL\n\nWill allow bigger programs to be inputted without getting a 'maximum\nsetlocal recursion level reached' error.", "created_at": "2016-11-01T18:26:50Z", "repo": "Brainfuck-In-Batch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "e6f3dc8e8acadd6097e8034a422fe415b8d8ca16", "message": "Add ascii/ascii*.txt files\n\nAdd the ascii files as generated by the Python script.", "created_at": "2016-11-01T15:17:02Z", "repo": "Brainfuck-In-Batch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "7133bb888cfda0040adc9377ccd4131af334f102", "message": "Update :GETCHAR and :PUTCHAR\n\n:GETCHAR can now output to any variable (using an argument), and\n:PUTCHAR takes input as argument aswell.", "created_at": "2016-11-01T15:14:26Z", "repo": "Brainfuck-In-Batch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "5a09ae9a7300e46e0e00a13f13a3198aacedeaa3", "message": "Make line endings CRLF\n\nMake the line endings CRLF. Also tries to move Interpreter.bat to\ninterpreter.bat", "created_at": "2016-11-01T15:11:44Z", "repo": "Brainfuck-In-Batch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "82c5d17392f796692197490b9cc84bedf69bb2bd", "message": "Fix interpreter\n\nRemoved `SET CODE=!CODE:~1,-1~` on line 17 (Used to be used to remove\nquotation marks).\nMade input work.\nMade output able to optionally print every character, by running\n`genascii.py` or manually adding `ascii/ascii#.txt` files.", "created_at": "2016-11-01T13:05:08Z", "repo": "Brainfuck-In-Batch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "9698805ed88b2f45997562b34cbc2faf8286a0f9", "message": "Move example programs", "created_at": "2016-11-01T12:52:42Z", "repo": "Brainfuck-In-Batch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "db69f29eee33339a3ce8a70e6883f5810765b96b", "message": "Remove debug instruction\n\nRemoved line 28 (`<NUL SET /P=!INSTR!`), whoops :P", "created_at": "2016-04-05T17:05:13Z", "repo": "Brainfuck-In-Batch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "f2988f67742da2dbedb3e59820a03633ffb049f7", "message": "Add new features\n\nBoth program and input data are now taken directly from stdin.\nAs a consequence, everything past a `!` will now be read as input.\n\nFixed the `ABC` bug, where printing several incremental ASCII\n characters would skip to the last one, and only output that one.\n\nRenamed `SETCHAR` to `PUTCHAR`.\n\nNew stack based aproach for loops (Should be alot more performant).\n\nAdded jumps to directly go to next loop after instruction has\n been handled (Should also be more performant).", "created_at": "2016-04-03T21:07:23Z", "repo": "Brainfuck-In-Batch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "a88e319eab076f52c79e00b724b72d34fec2933d", "message": "Initial commit", "created_at": "2016-04-03T17:02:32Z", "repo": "Brainfuck-In-Batch", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "0c8fab088bf3696046c6299ce45f099cfa114385", "message": "Merge branch 'master' of https://github.com/YoYoYonnY/lambda-language", "created_at": "2015-06-17T18:38:32Z", "repo": "lambda-language", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "3c8e140013407a5d90a47f6fabc6d4ed23013658", "message": "Fixed type of ArrayList (Now ArrayList<Object> instead of ArrayList<String>)", "created_at": "2015-06-17T18:36:04Z", "repo": "lambda-language", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "2cad7fca0051e2d58fc390930a028a143991ff8f", "message": "Update README.md", "created_at": "2015-06-17T15:37:19Z", "repo": "lambda-language", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "e222f44c46790f2c6fef78c69f3f2181aa12d5ee", "message": "Update test.lambda", "created_at": "2015-06-17T15:10:08Z", "repo": "lambda-language", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "68f18b9cef664b82fcfebf3f680c0c44b3631e35", "message": "Merge branch 'master' of https://github.com/YoYoYonnY/lambda-language", "created_at": "2015-06-17T15:08:44Z", "repo": "lambda-language", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ecd37f3f5b6e5b5d0866c1c250263e113b5151f1", "message": "Initial commit", "created_at": "2015-06-17T15:04:50Z", "repo": "lambda-language", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "49109390922fbca39ea2d10860cc5193967d0f18", "message": "Create Argument.java", "created_at": "2015-06-17T14:48:25Z", "repo": "lambda-language", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "bee39b5379d5928649b5c4cc464065ed5becd4b2", "message": "Create Lambda.java", "created_at": "2015-06-17T14:47:58Z", "repo": "lambda-language", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "484f116c7b81adde4125a6873a39aca4f30965af", "message": "Initial commit", "created_at": "2015-06-17T14:45:52Z", "repo": "lambda-language", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "02c7759d82abdc3283742bbcf10b06de4c061025", "message": "Added files.", "created_at": "2015-10-20T21:39:58Z", "repo": "Processing", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "19ba869fa573b3f429a477ef8e830493e884d1f4", "message": "Initial commit", "created_at": "2015-10-20T21:08:11Z", "repo": "Processing", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}], "prs": []}